<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila planitibia detail-tier Turing wavelength (5.13 µm, Holocene 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each math-kg equation names a Lean declaration and a code range: Jacobian and threshold (L95–149, Lean traceDiffusion), fastest-mode wavelength (L155–226, lambdaDetailNm), and the ablation (L229–265). The docstring states the 5.13 µm scale and the 0 Ma age delta before any numerical result." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila planitibia detail-tier Turing wavelength (5.13 µm, Holocene 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 seeds modes 4–16, where the leading eigenvalue is real, on that eigenvector and fits the log-slope of the cosine projection. Pearson r = 0.99999993 against eig(J(k)) of the same 5-point Laplacian (RMSE 7.20e-05, 13 modes). Homogeneous state has trace < 0 and det > 0; nominal d = 18.6 is unstable and d = 1 is stable, matching the Lean trace-diffusion theorems. The score stays below 95 because the kinetics are generic Schnakenberg parameters placed at an assigned length, not a species-published parameter table." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila planitibia detail-tier Turing wavelength (5.13 µm, Holocene 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "measure_morphoeval reports seven comparisons whose values are not copies of their references: dispersion r = 0.99999993 versus 1, linear-regime wavelength 5.0972 µm versus 5.13 µm, specimen spiral ridge 67.5676 µm versus 5.13 µm, Otsu circularity 0.6619 versus 1, radial KS 0.7190 versus 0, ablation ratio 45.7569 versus 1, and D_u ratio versus D. persimilis 520.1600 versus 1. Continuous-symbol wavelength on the same dx is 5.177 µm." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-activator-diffusivity-ratio-versus-d-persimilis>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-ablation-amplitude-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-linear-regime-stripe-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-largest-contour-circularity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-scale-bar-spiral-carrier-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-vs-simulation-radial-spectrum-ks-statistic>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-planitibia-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-turing-dispersion-pearson-r-linear-pde-vs-discrete-symbol>,
